  - m_Id: 143085093994496
    m_Localized: Corner Calibration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143086989819904
    m_Localized: 'Corner Calibration Instructions:



      Drag the CYAN corners
      around the shape of the sandbox in the depth image.



      Drag the RED corners
      to the actual corners projected onto the sandbox (Look at projection).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143088579461120
    m_Localized: Depth Calibration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143223535386624
    m_Localized: 'Depth Calibration Instructions:



      Touch the LOWEST part
      of the depth image and then the HIGHEST.



      The depth range can be fine-tuned
      with the sliders to the right.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143224378441728
    m_Localized: 'Lens Shift

      Calibration'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143225137610752
    m_Localized: 'Lens Shift Calibration Instructions:



      Use the Lens Shift
      option to make the peaks and troughs line up on the projection. Note that you
      will probably have to use the Horizontal Translation afterwards to line up
      the projection properly.



      Use the other options to fine tune the calibration.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
